{
 "stateless-1": {
  "audioSec": 16.733,
  "audioFrames": 502,
  "duration": 510,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "timing.mimo.json:stateless-1",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "你刚登录完一个网站，点开下一页，它照样知道你是谁。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 4.337
   },
   {
    "text": "可 HTTP 本身是无状态的：每一次请求，对服务器来说都像第一次见面，它记不住上一次是谁来过。",
    "start": 4.617,
    "dur": 8.072
   },
   {
    "text": "要是每点一页都得重新输一次密码，谁也受不了。",
    "start": 12.97,
    "dur": 3.756
   }
  ],
  "knollChapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "globalShift": 0
 },
 "stateless-2": {
  "audioSec": 4.5,
  "audioFrames": 135,
  "duration": 145,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 510,
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "timing.mimo.json:stateless-1",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "那网站是怎么认出你的？",
    "start": 0.006,
    "dur": 2.242
   },
   {
    "text": "答案就在存包处。",
    "start": 2.528,
    "dur": 1.967
   }
  ],
  "knollChapterOffsetFrames": 510,
  "globalShift": 0
 },
 "set-cookie-1": {
  "audioSec": 18.567,
  "audioFrames": 557,
  "duration": 618,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "timing.mimo.json:set-cookie-1",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "在存包处寄存东西，柜台会给你一张手牌。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 3.893
   },
   {
    "text": "登录也一样：密码验证通过后，服务器在响应里加一行 Set Cookie，交给浏览器一张手牌。",
    "start": 4.173,
    "dur": 7.066
   },
   {
    "text": "手牌上只写着一串编号，叫会话 I D，浏览器把它收好，这就是 Cookie。",
    "start": 13.019,
    "dur": 5.535
   }
  ],
  "knollChapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "globalShift": 0,
  "origDuration": 522,
  "extraHold": 45,
  "holdAt": 341,
  "labelHold": 51
 },
 "send-1": {
  "audioSec": 9.133,
  "audioFrames": 274,
  "duration": 282,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "timing.mimo.json:send-1",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "之后再访问这个网站，浏览器会自动在每个请求里带上这张手牌，不用你动手。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 6.382
   },
   {
    "text": "服务器看一眼编号，就知道是你。",
    "start": 6.662,
    "dur": 2.456
   }
  ],
  "knollChapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "globalShift": 96
 },
 "send-2": {
  "audioSec": 9.5,
  "audioFrames": 285,
  "duration": 295,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 282,
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "timing.mimo.json:send-1",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "关掉页面再回来，只要手牌还在、服务器那边的登记也还有效，它就还认得你。",
    "start": -0.002,
    "dur": 5.23
   },
   {
    "text": "手牌只会交给发它的那个网站，别的网站读不到。",
    "start": 5.488,
    "dur": 4.01
   }
  ],
  "knollChapterOffsetFrames": 282,
  "globalShift": 96
 },
 "session-1": {
  "audioSec": 8.167,
  "audioFrames": 245,
  "duration": 254,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "timing.mimo.json:session-1",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "真正的东西存在柜台里，也就是服务器那边的 Session。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 4.319
   },
   {
    "text": "它按编号记着：这是谁，登录到什么时候。",
    "start": 4.599,
    "dur": 3.584
   }
  ],
  "knollChapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "globalShift": 96
 },
 "session-2": {
  "audioSec": 8.667,
  "audioFrames": 260,
  "duration": 315,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 254,
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "timing.mimo.json:session-1",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "手牌本身只是一串编号，不装你的密码。",
    "start": -0.004,
    "dur": 3.597
   },
   {
    "text": "可柜台只认手牌不认人，谁拿着它，谁就能取走东西。",
    "start": 3.873,
    "dur": 4.779
   }
  ],
  "knollChapterOffsetFrames": 254,
